config PINCTRL_ROCKCHIP_RK3506
	bool "Rockchip RK3506 pinctrl driver"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_ROCKCHIP_RK3506_PINCTRL_ENABLED
	help
	  Enable the Rockchip RK3506 pin controller driver. It supports
	  pin mux selection, bias, drive strength, schmitt trigger, input
	  enable, open drain, and slew-rate configuration.
